B.a77=new A.hd("Say, \u201cO My servants who have transgressed against themselves [by sinning], do not despair of the mercy of Allah. Indeed, Allah forgives all sins.\u201d","Quran 39:53 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.a7m=new A.hd("\u2026despair not of relief from Allah\u2026","Quran 12:87 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.a7b=new A.hd("Allah is more pleased with the repentance of His servant than a traveller who finds his lost camel again.","Sahih Muslim 2747 \u2014 summary",!1)
B.a7d=new A.hd("If you did not sin, Allah would replace you with a people who sin, seek forgiveness, and are forgiven.","Sahih Muslim 2749 \u2014 summary",!1)
B.a7o=new A.hd("\u2026indeed I am near. I respond to the invocation of the supplicant when he calls upon Me\u2026","Quran 2:186 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.a7i=new A.hd("A man who had killed ninety-nine people asked whether he could still repent, and the hadith tells us the door was open to him. Nothing you have done has closed a door Allah keeps open.","Sahih Muslim 2766 \u2014 the hundred-souls hadith, summary",!1)
B.a7p=new A.hd("Allah accepts the repentance of His servant until the soul reaches the throat.","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3537 \u2014 hasan (Darussalam)",!1)
B.a7n=new A.hd("For indeed, with hardship [will be] ease. Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease.","Quran 94:5\u20136",!1)
B.a7c=new A.hd("No fatigue, illness, worry, grief, harm or distress touches a Muslim, even a thorn\u2019s prick, but Allah expiates some of his sins for it.","Sahih al-Bukhari 5641 \u2014 summary",!0)
